      "content": "\"Stopping the fight\" means accepting that you don't have to carry this unbearable weight all by yourself, or even on your own. If the loop of loneliness feels inescapable, maybe the most immediate relief is finding a way to break the pattern, even if it's just by making a very small, quiet change. You don't have to fix everything; sometimes, the only thing you need to do is let the pressure release, and that can be a very gentle step toward quiet.",
